  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人工智慧的產業應用",
    "sub_ename": "INDUSTRIAL APPLICATIONS OF ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE",
    "describe_ch": "將以市面上人工智慧在各產業的應用實例說明介紹,並介紹在人工智慧下的生意模式的改變, 將以案例剖析那些已經導入人工智慧技術?技術上與資訊工程課程關係?讓學生理解人工智慧應用情境,在日常生活中那些已經利用默默導入人工智慧,及未來的機會,並藉由案例讓學生知道”資料”重要性,怎找出數據的價值,並啟發找尋AI應用機會",
    "describe_eh": "Explain the application cases of artificial intelligence in various industries, influence the changes in business models, understand the application context of artificial intelligence, use cases to illustrate the importance of &quot;data&quot; and the value of data, and inspire to find AI application opportunities",
